  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcing the Scale Up of HIV Services byStrengthening HIV Prevention and Effective Targeting - Ghana (01-Jul-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana, HIV, Ghana AIDS Commission (GAC)This program has the following goals: To reduce new HIV infections and deaths among men, women, children and neonates in the next 3 years. The objectives of this program are: To improve the screening of HIV exposed infants from 37% to 95%.  To increase the ART coverage from 60% in 2013 to 70% in 2017.  To increase the coverage of key populations accessing HIV testing and counseling</narrative>
  </description>
